01:14:53.100 --> 01:14:55.410
and during that entire seven months,

01:14:55.410 --> 01:14:58.920
they never once ever washed their towel

01:14:58.920 --> 01:15:01.020
that they used for showers.

01:15:01.020 --> 01:15:03.570
I would see them frequently
using it as a hand towel

01:15:03.570 --> 01:15:06.660
and blowing their nose and after a shower.

01:15:06.660 --> 01:15:09.330
So after like seven months of just months

01:15:09.330 --> 01:15:14.070
and months of just grim
and mildew and spills,

01:15:14.070 --> 01:15:17.340
he finally, finally, finally decided

01:15:17.340 --> 01:15:20.520
to just throw it away
instead of washing it.

01:15:20.520 --> 01:15:21.510
Hey, Rhett and Link.

01:15:21.510 --> 01:15:23.130
My name is Ashley from Oregon

01:15:23.130 --> 01:15:25.830
and my bad neighbor
story is that years ago

01:15:25.830 --> 01:15:27.900
I slipped on the sidewalk
outside of my apartment

01:15:27.900 --> 01:15:29.160
and injured my foot.

01:15:29.160 --> 01:15:30.810
As I was lying there, crying in pain,

01:15:30.810 --> 01:15:32.310
my neighbor came running out.

01:15:32.310 --> 01:15:33.780
I thought he was going to help me,

01:15:33.780 --> 01:15:37.350
but instead he hovered
his hands over my foot

01:15:37.350 --> 01:15:39.930
and insisted that he was healing me.

01:15:39.930 --> 01:15:41.160
Needless to say, it didn't work

01:15:41.160 --> 01:15:44.760
and I actually had broken
my foot in multiple places.

